# "{T}: When you next cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy" (CR 603.7b,
# 707.10, 707.10c). Cursed Recording is tapped (an artifact, so no summoning sickness) and a delayed ability waits. The first Lightning
# Bolt, at Bot2, is copied and Bot1 aims the copy at itself: 3 damage each, and the copy is not cast, so it adds no time counter. The
# ability tapped Recording, so it cannot be activated again; the second Bolt is not copied ("next" is once): Bot2 ends at 14, Bot1 at 17.

